Subject: [PATCH 23/24] oplus-fwk: close the AIUnit class surface
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Close the framework class surface the AIUnit system apps reference:

  * Add OplusHansFreezeManager, OplusLockPatternUtils and the
    CryptoengNative sysapi shim.
  * Fold AIUnit isMultiSystemUserId into the existing OplusMultiUserManager
    (dedup the duplicate class).
  * Close the RomUpdate OTA-check and AIUnit StatsEvent call sites
    (OplusPackageManager / OplusSystemUpdateInfo / StatsEvent).

Change-Id: I3c135898e091ddd8d33593edff27383195a966e6
(cherry picked from commit e334fb78c70ac267351f5525f3be7bbacc71a2e5)

Ledger: hardware_oplus.md Accepted Group C row 12 (e334fb78)
Stub-matrix: task-9-stub-inventory.md row K07 — consumers: AIUnit+VideoGallery (OplusHansFreezeManager/OplusLockPatternUtils/OplusSystemUpdateInfo, dex-scan); location: oplus-fwk boot jar
Change-Id: Ic0f9501ee02cf69d8f6ab4a203f9d6c179cfaab2
